# Context filter for monorepo-rooted Docker builds (currently
# apps/studio/Dockerfile; apps/fresco's Dockerfile builds from its mirrored
# standalone repository, not this context).
.git
# Local environment files must never enter the build context — layers and
# exported build caches would retain any credentials they carry.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-web
**/out
**/.next
**/.nitro
**/.output
**/storybook-static
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
